    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Mugonzenga Musengwa Katonda waimwe buliidho, era mutuukirizenga byonabyona by'ayenda mukole: amateeka ge, n'ebiragiro bye, n'okulamba kwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukimanhe olwaleero muti tiri kwogera na baana baimwe abakaali kumanha na kubona nga Musengwa Katonda waimwe bw'akangaivula. Niimwe omwabona nga bw'ali omukologho, era ow'amaani amangi agataloodheka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabona ebyewuunhio n'ebyewuninkiriza, bye yakolera e Misiri ku kyabazinga waayo, ni ku nsi Misiri yoonayoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kuv 7:8—12:13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwabona nga Musengwa Katonda bweyasaanizaagho irala eigye ly'Abamisiri, n'embalaasi dhaibwe, n'ebigaali byaibwe eby'omu lutalo. Yaabayoolookezaaku amaadhi g'Enhandha Emyufu, gaabamira bwe baali nga bali kulumuukirira imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 14:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhi bye yabakolera nga muli mu irungu, okutuusa lwe mwatuuka mu kifo kino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mwidhukira kye yakola Dathani ni Abiramu batabane ba Eliabu ow'omu kika kya Reubeni. Musengwa Katonda oyo yaleetera eitaka okwasama ng'Abaisiraeli boonaboona babona, lyamira abantu abo, n'ab'omu maka gaibwe, n'eweema dhaibwe, na kiisi kiramu kye baali nakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.31+NUM.16.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 16:31-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwenebwene mwabona eby'amaani ebyo byonabyona Musengwa Katonda bye yakola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale ni mutuukirizenga ebiragiro byonabyona bye ndi kubagha olwaleero, mughange okuba n'amaani, musomoke omwiga, muje mutwale ensi ye muli kumpi okwingiramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olwo musobole okughangaalira mu nsi eyo engimu era erimu ebirungi kamaala, Musengwa Katonda ye yasuubiza okugha badhaadha baimwe n'eizaire lyaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi ye muli kuja okwingiramu okutwala, teri ng'oti ni Misiri ye mwavaamu, mwe mwasiganga ensigo ni mukola n'amaani okudhifukirira, ng'enimiro y'eiva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nsi ya nsozi na biiko, efukirirwa amaadhi agagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi eyo Musengwa Katonda waimwe agirabirira ekiseera kyonakyona, okuva omwaka lwe gutoolera okutuusa lwe guwaaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale ni mufubenga okutuukiriza ebiragiro, bye mbaghaire olwaleero. Mugonzenga Musengwa Katonda waimwe, mumugheerezenga n'omutima gwaimwe gwonagwona, n'omwoyo gwaimwe gwonagwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.26.3+LEV.26.4+LEV.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 26:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.12+DEU.7.13+DEU.7.14+DEU.7.15+DEU.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 7:12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.1+DEU.28.2+DEU.28.3+DEU.28.4+DEU.28.5+DEU.28.6+DEU.28.7+DEU.28.8+DEU.28.9+DEU.28.10+DEU.28.11+DEU.28.12+DEU.28.13+DEU.28.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo aidha kugwisanga amaadhi mu nsi yaimwe mu biseera byago eby'omusambya n'eby'omutoigo. Olwo musobolenga okukungula engaano, n'okufuna omwenge ogw'emizabbibu n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha kubaghanga eisubi ery'ensolo dhaimwe mu byayiro byaimwe. N'imwe beene mwidhanga kufuna emere yoonayoona ye mwetaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwekuume mulobenga kusendebwasendebwa ni muva ku Musengwa Katonda, ni musinza bakatonda abandi era ni mubagheereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe mulikola mutyo, obusungu bwa Musengwa Katonda bulibatumbukiraku ng'oti muliro, Musengwa Katonda oyo yaalobera amaadhi okugwa, ensi yaakala yaaloba kubaza mere, era mwazikirira mangu, waire nga muliba mu nsi engimu Musengwa Katonda y'ali kubagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukuumenga ebiragiro byange ebyo mu mitima ni mu myoyo gyaimwe. Mubyesibenga ku mikono gyaimwe, era mubyetimbenga mu byeni byaimwe ng'akamanhiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.6.6+DEU.6.7+DEU.6.8+DEU.6.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 6:6-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubyegeresenga abaana baimwe. Era mubyogerengaku nga muli ghaka, oba nga muli mu ngira muli kutambula, nga mulambaire, oba nga musitwikegho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubighandiikenga ku myango egy'emiryango egy'endhu dhaimwe, ni ku miryango gy'ebibuga byaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo imwe n'abaana baimwe, mughange okughangaalira mu nsi Musengwa Katonda ye yasuubiza okugha badhaadha baimwe. Era mugibeemu ekiseera kyonakyona eigulu kye lirimala nga liri ghaigulu gh'ensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukuumenga amateeka ge mbateereiregho obutagavangaku, nga mugonza Musengwa Katonda waimwe, nga mujiira ku ebyo by'abalagira, era nga muba beesigwa y'ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo aidha kubingangamu amaghanga agandi ago goonagoona nga mukaali kugatuukaku. Olwo imwe mwingire mutwale ensi ey'amaghanga agasinga eryaimwe obukologho n'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kifo kye munaaniinangaku ekigere, kiidha kubanga kyaimwe. Ensalosalo dhaimwe dhinaavanga ku irungu ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba, dhaatuuka ku nsozi dh'e Lebanoni ku luuyi olw'omukono omugooda olw'e buvandhuba. Era dhinaavanga ku mwiga Eufurate mu buvandhuba, dhaatuuka ku Nhandha Eyaghagati mu bugwandhuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.3+JOS.1.4+JOS.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 1:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tighaliba muntu waire omulala alighanga kubeekiikamu. Kuba buli ye munaajanga, Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kuleeteranga abantu baayo kubatya butye, nga bweyabasuubiza imwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Olwaleero ndi kubagha mulondegho, okugheebwa enkabi oba okukolimirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kugheebwanga enkabi, bwe munaawuliranga ebiragiro bya Musengwa Katonda waimwe bye ndi kubagha olwaleero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kukolimirwanga bwe mutaawulirenga biragiro bya Musengwa Katonda waimwe, ni mukyuka okuva ku bye ndi kubalagira olwaleero, aye ni mwira mu kusinza bakatonda be mutasinzangaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni Musengwa Katonda waimwe bw'alibatuusa mu nsi ye muja okutwala, mulirangirira enkabi nga muli ku lusozi Gerizimu, ate mwalangirira ekikolimo nga muli ku lusozi Ebali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 27:11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.33+JOS.8.34+JOS.8.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 8:33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensozi edho dhombi dhiri ere ng'osomoike omwiga Yorudani, mu nsi y'Abakanaani ababa mu kiiko kya Yorudani okwolekera Giligali, mu mbali mw'omuti omukologho ogw'e More. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli kumpi okusomoka omwiga Yorudani, okwingira okutwala ensi Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'ali kubagha. Bwe muligitwala ni mugibaamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwegenderezanga okutuukiriza amateeka goonagoona n'ebiragiro bye ndi kubagha olwaleero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
